sequenceDiagram
  participant Orch as Orchestrator
  participant Reg as Agent Registry
  participant Bus as Message Board
  participant Agent as Code Worker
  participant Gate as Permission Gateway

  Agent->>Reg: register agent-card
  Agent->>Reg: heartbeat
  Orch->>Reg: list agents with code.inspect
  Reg->>Orch: code-worker-01
  Orch->>Bus: task.assigned
  Agent->>Bus: consume task
  Agent->>Bus: task.progress
  Agent->>Gate: request file.write permission
  Gate->>Bus: permission.requested
  Bus->>Agent: permission.decided allow_once
  Agent->>Bus: task.completed
  Orch->>Bus: consume result
